        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Treinamento de Alta Retenção</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white flex items-center gap-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group text-purple-500"></i> Top 20 Flashcards Interativos 3D (USMLE Style)
